      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": true,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>So does the extra movement from &quot;<span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 'PT Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Unrelenting Momentum&quot; have to be used imeadiatly? or can a make say two movements attack and then use the extra provided by &quot;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 'PT Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Unrelenting Momentum&quot; to run away,</span></p>",
