    {
      "id": 116752,
      "name": "phantaskippy",
      "username": "phantaskippy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-31T02:47:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>After you do the second action you immediately take the free action.</p><p>You fully resolve the action though, so you can use accelerated assault or resolve attacks from Hypersonic before doing the free action, but you can't do anything between like an action or even using lightspeed Barrage.</p>",
