      "raw": "<p>After you do the second action you immediately take the free action.</p><p>You fully resolve the action though, so you can use accelerated assault or resolve attacks from Hypersonic before doing the free action, but you can&#39;t do anything between like an action or even using lightspeed Barrage.</p>",
