      "created_at": "2014-09-13T12:00:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The only problem I see is your extra LSB, LSB isn't an action, so momentum won't affect it.</p><p>Other that that looks good.</p><p>You could get more total attack dice from using Pushing the Limits, but you are trading 5 3d attacks for 1 6d attack, it might not be worth it.</p>",
